            "heading": "Don\u2019t let extreme weather rain on your clients\u2019 retirement strategy",
            "headingHtml": "<h2>Don\u2019t let extreme weather rain on your clients\u2019 retirement strategy</h2>",
            "headingLevel": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "body": "<p>Many Americans are concerned about the rising costs tied to extreme weather, yet few have taken steps to plan for it, according to the 2026 Annual Retirement Study. From higher insurance premiums to unexpected recovery expenses, these costs can disrupt long-term financial goals.</p>\n<p>By discussing the financial impact of extreme weather, financial professionals can help clients build a more holistic retirement strategy.</p>",
